// spec: RT-010
//
// Max was a built-in and is not one now.  It was removed in Generation 9
// rather than moved to a library, because nothing called it: every mention of
// it in the compiler's own source was a comment.
//
// ⚠️ A removal needs a case as much as an addition does.  Without one, nothing
// would notice a Max quietly coming back -- and the rule it left behind is a
// tombstone, which cites this.

WriteLn (Max (1, 2));
